OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 21, dies after being found
OL,4,Aseriously injured in hospital car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Ffound with serious injuries in a car
OL,8,Fpark at Ninewells Hospital in Dundee.
OL,10,FHe was found at about 03:45 and taken
OL,11,Finto the hospital but died a short time
OL,12,Flater.
OL,14,FPolice have learned that he was earlier
OL,15,Finjured in Ladyloan, Arbroath.
OL,17,FA 25-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,18,Fconnection with the death and police
OL,19,Finquiries are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
